{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>尖沙咀文化中心中午懷疑發生電力故障起火，一名女子觸電燒傷。<br/></p><p>20多歲的女傷者，面及頭敷上敷料，由救護員送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p></p><p>警方約11時半接獲文化中心保安報案，指懷疑劇場因電力故障起火，消防指到場後火勢已熄滅。</p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TST-1230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mNPm8bdQf41792385564.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T07:39:35.310737+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:57:59.710458+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T07:37:52.075538+00:00","content_hash":"0e0dfb9ae47bf031cfe76556a468802438a2876ab5a53e6915b0f07239f44480","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}